---
description: Finding quarantine and delta escalation
alwaysApply: true
---

Finding classifications:
- IMPLEMENTATION_BUG
- TEST_BUG
- SPEC_AMBIGUITY
- DESIGN_DELTA_CANDIDATE
- BUILD_BLOCKER

IMPLEMENTATION_BUG and TEST_BUG may stay in the automated fast loop only when the locked contract remains unchanged.

SPEC_AMBIGUITY, DESIGN_DELTA_CANDIDATE, and contract-affecting BUILD_BLOCKER:
- mark affected task BLOCKED;
- create a Finding with expected/actual/evidence/attempts;
- do not change Build Spec;
- wait for human governance.

Governed Delta types:
- DESIGN_DELTA
- IMPLEMENTATION_DELTA
- TEST_DELTA
- DEBUG_FINDING
- FIX_DELTA

Only DESIGN_DELTA may require a new Build Spec baseline, and only after upstream NodeFF Working + User approval.
